 "caveats": [
  "N (hidden truth size) is not identifiable from the corpus alone: it is chosen by leave-cluster-out and reported, and every score estimate is conditional on it.",
  "TP_i = sum of per-dot credit assumes no two dots of a file share a truth pixel; at the corpus' dot densities this over-attributes credit by at most the crowding factor.",
  "Scores are OWNER-REPORT transcriptions with no organizer receipt; a mistyped value propagates into the fit.",
  "The candidate emitted from this field is drawn from the top of the very field whose accuracy is claimed, so the estimate is optimistic by construction; the reported gloo-vs-in-sample gap is the size of that optimism."
 ]
